{"tool_name":"neuronmetrics","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The invention comprises a software tool, NeuronMetrics, which functions as a set of modules that run in the open-source program ImageJ. NeuronMetrics features a novel method for estimating neural \u201cbranch number\u201d (a measure of the axonal complexity) from two-dimensional images. In addition, the tool features a novel method for modeling neural structure in large \u201cgaps\u201d that result from image artifacts.</p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>","summary":"","value":"<p>The invention comprises a software tool, NeuronMetrics, which functions as a set of modules that run in the open-source program ImageJ. NeuronMetrics features a novel method for estimating neural \u201cbranch number\u201d (a measure of the axonal complexity) from two-dimensional images. In addition, the tool features a novel method for modeling neural structure in large \u201cgaps\u201d that result from image artifacts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-29T08:49:30+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-09-12T16:21:39+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505234430,"last_comment_uid":160,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Rakhi Gibbons"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4368,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"0b8752f1-33bc-45df-9d25-aa3870bdf426","url":"/taxonomy/term/4368"},{"target_id":4369,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"48c26d93-5406-41f3-909e-17c44e39e123","url":"/taxonomy/term/4369"},{"target_id":4370,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"44d51c26-0759-4806-84dc-8a89d6e31193","url":"/taxonomy/term/4370"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"h